OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Flocally heavy rain to start, becoming
OL,7,Fmore settled and drier overnight,
OL,8,Fclearing skies as the rain moves
OL,9,Feastwards into the North Sea. Winds
OL,10,Fwill ease slightly by the morning
OL,11,Finland but remaining strong near the
OL,12,Fcoast.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FChilly start Saturday, but
OL,15,Fturning wet and windy with rain
OL,16,Fspreading east from late morning,
OL,17,Fbecoming heavy at times. Winds will
OL,18,Fincrease and become strong with hill
OL,19,Fand coastal gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
